1
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:10,300
This agent owns a two-hundred-and-fifty-thousand-euro
supplier obligation. The required evidence never arrives.

2
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:16,867
No crash. No exception. I click once;
from here, the browser only watches.

3
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:25,200
Cloud Tasks crosses the persisted deadline. Continuum checks
Firestore for the evidence that should exist and proves it is absent.

4
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:33,880
It publishes that negative-space signal. The first Pub/Sub attempt fails
deliberately; the same durable workflow resumes on redelivery.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Three departments have published immutable successor records.
Code rejects v20 for health and jurisdiction before the model sees it.

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:53,500
Google ADK gives Gemini 3.6 only the eligible set and incident objective.
Gemini chooses warm successor v19 and cites the trade-off.

7
00:00:53,500 --> 00:01:02,280
Deterministic policy validates that recommendation before authority moves.
The model can reason; it cannot mint permission.

8
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:12,500
v17 is fenced at the new authority epoch. Its action is stale,
and revoked memory is rejected before retrieval.

9
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:21,000
Continuum reconstructs context for the purpose:
the obligation and two verified facts cross.

10
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:29,160
Prompt injection, a predecessor secret, stale inference, and revoked memory
stay behind. The agent is replaceable. Its promise is not.

11
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:41,500
v19 resumes the actual job. It checks the legal entity through GLEIF
and European Union VAT through VIES.

12
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:50,000
Each normalized observation is hashed before Gemini sees it.
Gemini produces a cited decision pack.

13
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:58,360
Deterministic admission rechecks the sources, controls, requested action,
and sandbox scope. This is a synthetic supplier case, not a commercial decision.

14
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:16,500
The gateway rechecks identity, epoch, policy, decision pack,
context, and idempotency in one transaction.

15
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:25,809
Pub/Sub delivers twice. The external queue still contains one reversible
synthetic work item: one effect, zero duplicates under this demonstrated boundary.

16
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Execution is still only a claim. The control plane exports
five content-addressed artifacts.

17
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:50,927
A separately deployed read-only verifier resolves every digest and rereads
authority, supplier, and provider state. Only it may issue artifact six.
This run is verified.

18
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:08,500
The accepted release runs across five private Cloud Run identities with
Firestore, Cloud Tasks, Pub/Sub, Vertex AI, and Cloud Trace.

19
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:18,037
Its public packet contains seventeen required objects and one hundred
seventy-four correlated spans. The offline verifier returns pass.

20
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:28,500
Google Cloud is the reference binding;
the Continuity Contract is the portable proposal.

21
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:37,400
Only a verified incident may teach: Gemma creates a cited drill, and Veo plus
Lyria render derivative training media, never authority or evidence.

22
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:53,800
Continuum keeps an institution's promise alive when the agent responsible
for it fails. The agent failed. The promise did not.
